{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57207","headline":"偈 · 宝志","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顿悟心源开宝藏，隐显灵踪现真相。\n独行独坐常巍巍，百亿化身无数量。\n纵令畐塞满虚空，看时不见微尘相。\n可笑物空无比况，口吐明珠光晃晃。\n寻常见说不思议，一语标宗言下当。\n（《宗镜录》卷九八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}